# Build-context exclusions for `nomikos/Dockerfile`.
#
# This used to be `.dockerignore` at the repository root. It is named for its
# Dockerfile instead because a `.dockerignore` is only read from the *build
# context* root, and the context for this image is the repository root - so the
# file could not simply move into `infrastructure/` with the Compose files
# without silently disabling every exclusion below. BuildKit reads
# `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the context's `.dockerignore`,
# which lets the rules live next to the Dockerfile they belong to.
#
# The consequence of that lookup failing is not a slow build, it is `**/.env`,
# `.git` and the virtualenv entering the context, so
# `tests/nomikos/unit/test_deployment_hardening.py` asserts this file exists and
# still names them. BuildKit is required: the pre-23 classic builder
# (`DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0`) does not implement the sidecar and would ship the whole
# tree.
#
# The frontend image is unaffected - it builds from the `nomikos/` context and
# reads `nomikos/.dockerignore`.

**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
.cursor
.docker-cache/
.git
.gitignore
agent-transcripts
issues
_support_repo

# Large local-only trees (mounted as volumes in compose, not needed in images)
data/

# Tests and docs are not shipped in production images
tests/
docs/
# Training configuration. Renamed from `configs/` by 4b1262f; no COPY in either
# Dockerfile reads it, so this only keeps it out of the build context.
config/

# Model weights are mounted at runtime, not baked into images. Keep the Python
# package initializer so `from inference.weights import ...` works in the image.
inference/weights
!inference/
!inference/weights/
!inference/weights/__init__.py

# Only the Hub resolver is needed by the inference image.  Docker ignore
# negations must re-include both ancestor directories and concrete files.
# Keep local caches, staging trees, publishing helpers, and bundled weights
# outside the build context.
src/**
!src/
!src/hf/
!src/hf/__init__.py
!src/hf/paths.py
!src/hf/resolve/
!src/hf/resolve/**

# Frontend is built from nomikos/ context; exclude from repo-root API/inference builds
nomikos/frontend/
nomikos/backend/media
nomikos/data/

# Dev-only paths under nomikos
